Bind Npc 29072 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29073 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 802 "[Crack of All Means] Uncontrollable Mana"
    Journal for karus "You must help with the experiment of [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Harrigan."
    Journal for elmorad "You must help with the experiment of [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Marcus."
    Collect 10 of 900331000
    Collect 1 of 900332000

Requires player level >= 58 and quest 801 is completed

Rewards
    Give 22500000 experience
    Give 1 of 900333000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Harrigon's a bit weird... Talk to him again."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Marcus seems a bit weird. Talk to him again."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Could you help?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please obtain [Polluted mana remains] and [Pure mana remains]. You'll be able to collect them from where I send you.\n\nCollect [Polluted mana remains] and [Pure mana remains] from the place [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Harrigon sends you."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Could you help?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please obtain [Polluted mana remains] and [Pure mana remains]. You'll be able to collect them from where I send you.\n\nCollect [Polluted mana remains] and [Pure mana remains] from the place [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Marcus sends you."

On in_progress
    Say "I don't think you have enough.?"
    Topic "[Enter Dungeon]" do
        Enter instance 81 set 2 at 204 197

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Sure. This is enough.\n\nBring this [Mana remains sample] to Herga."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Sure. This is enough.\n\nBring this [Mana remains sample] to Nez."
